# Real system-PRX modules: decrypted Sony firmware (.prx/.sprx), relocated
# binary images (.linked.bin), and their lifted/generated namespaced sources.
# All regenerable via the ps3recomp tools/prx_* pipeline; never commit firmware.
prx/

# Build + run logs from iterative bring-up
build_*.log
run_*.out
run_*.err
